  "metadata": "{\"compiler\":{\"version\":\"0.8.20+commit.a1b79de6\"},\"language\":\"Solidity\",\"output\":{\"abi\":[{\"inputs\":[],\"stateMutability\":\"nonpayable\",\"type\":\"constructor\"},{\"anonymous\":false,\"inputs\":[{\"indexed\":true,\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"owner\",\"type\":\"address\"},{\"indexed\":true,\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"spender\",\"type\":\"address\"},{\"indexed\":false,\"internalType\":\"uint256\",\"name\":\"value\",\"type\":\"uint256\"}],\"name\":\"Approval\",\"type\":\"event\"},{\"anonymous\":false,\"inputs\":[{\"indexed\":true,\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"from\",\"type\":\"address\"},{\"indexed\":true,\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"to\",\"type\":\"address\"},{\"indexed\":false,\"internalType\":\"uint256\",\"name\":\"value\",\"type\":\"uint256\"}],\"name\":\"Transfer\",\"type\":\"event\"},{\"inputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"_owner\",\"type\":\"address\"},{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"spender\",\"type\":\"address\"}],\"name\":\"allowance\",\"outputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"uint256\",\"name\":\"\",\"type\":\"uint256\"}],\"stateMutability\":\"view\",\"type\":\"function\"},{\"inputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"spender\",\"type\":\"address\"},{\"internalType\":\"uint256\",\"name\":\"value\",\"type\":\"uint256\"}],\"name\":\"approve\",\"outputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"bool\",\"name\":\"\",\"type\":\"bool\"}],\"stateMutability\":\"nonpayable\",\"type\":\"function\"},{\"inputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"account\",\"type\":\"address\"}],\"name\":\"balanceOf\",\"outputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"uint256\",\"name\":\"\",\"type\":\"uint256\"}],\"stateMutability\":\"view\",\"type\":\"function\"},{\"inputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"uint256\",\"name\":\"value\",\"type\":\"uint256\"}],\"name\":\"burn\",\"outputs\":[],\"stateMutability\":\"nonpayable\",\"type\":\"function\"},{\"inputs\":[],\"name\":\"decimals\",\"outputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"uint8\",\"name\":\"\",\"type\":\"uint8\"}],\"stateMutability\":\"view\",\"type\":\"function\"},{\"inputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"to\",\"type\":\"address\"},{\"internalType\":\"uint256\",\"name\":\"value\",\"type\":\"uint256\"}],\"name\":\"mint\",\"outputs\":[],\"stateMutability\":\"nonpayable\",\"type\":\"function\"},{\"inputs\":[],\"name\":\"name\",\"outputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"string\",\"name\":\"\",\"type\":\"string\"}],\"stateMutability\":\"view\",\"type\":\"function\"},{\"inputs\":[],\"name\":\"owner\",\"outputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"\",\"type\":\"address\"}],\"stateMutability\":\"view\",\"type\":\"function\"},{\"inputs\":[],\"name\":\"symbol\",\"outputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"string\",\"name\":\"\",\"type\":\"string\"}],\"stateMutability\":\"view\",\"type\":\"function\"},{\"inputs\":[],\"name\":\"totalSupply\",\"outputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"uint256\",\"name\":\"\",\"type\":\"uint256\"}],\"stateMutability\":\"view\",\"type\":\"function\"},{\"inputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"to\",\"type\":\"address\"},{\"internalType\":\"uint256\",\"name\":\"value\",\"type\":\"uint256\"}],\"name\":\"transfer\",\"outputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"bool\",\"name\":\"\",\"type\":\"bool\"}],\"stateMutability\":\"nonpayable\",\"type\":\"function\"},{\"inputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"from\",\"type\":\"address\"},{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"to\",\"type\":\"address\"},{\"internalType\":\"uint256\",\"name\":\"value\",\"type\":\"uint256\"}],\"name\":\"transferFrom\",\"outputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"bool\",\"name\":\"\",\"type\":\"bool\"}],\"stateMutability\":\"nonpayable\",\"type\":\"function\"}],\"devdoc\":{\"kind\":\"dev\",\"methods\":{},\"version\":1},\"userdoc\":{\"kind\":\"user\",\"methods\":{},\"version\":1}},\"settings\":{\"compilationTarget\":{\"contracts/HHYToken.sol\":\"HHYToken\"},\"evmVersion\":\"paris\",\"libraries\":{},\"metadata\":{\"bytecodeHash\":\"ipfs\",\"useLiteralContent\":true},\"optimizer\":{\"enabled\":true,\"runs\":200},\"remappings\":[]},\"sources\":{\"contracts/HHYToken.sol\":{\"content\":\"// SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT\\r\\npragma solidity >=0.8.0 <0.9.0;\\r\\n\\r\\ncontract HHYToken {\\r\\n    // --- \\u5143\\u6570\\u636e ---\\r\\n    string public name = \\\"HHYToken\\\";\\r\\n    string public symbol = \\\"HHY202430550672\\\";\\r\\n    uint8 public decimals = 18;\\r\\n    uint256 public totalSupply;\\r\\n\\r\\n    // --- \\u6743\\u9650 ---\\r\\n    address public owner;\\r\\n\\r\\n    // \\u4fee\\u9970\\u5668\\uff1a\\u9650\\u5236\\u53ea\\u6709\\u5408\\u7ea6\\u7684 owner \\u624d\\u80fd\\u8c03\\u7528\\u88ab\\u4fee\\u9970\\u7684\\u51fd\\u6570\\r\\n    modifier onlyOwner() {\\r\\n        require(msg.sender == owner, \\\"HHYToken: caller is not the owner\\\");\\r\\n        _;\\r\\n    }\\r\\n\\r\\n    // --- \\u72b6\\u6001 ---\\r\\n    // \\u8fd9\\u4e24\\u4e2a mapping \\u5c31\\u662f\\u201c\\u8d26\\u672c\\u201d\\u3002\\u4ee3\\u5e01\\u4e0d\\u5b58\\u5728\\u4e8e\\u4efb\\u4f55\\u94b1\\u5305\\u91cc\\uff0c\\u53ea\\u5b58\\u5728\\u4e8e\\u8fd9\\u91cc\\u3002\\r\\n    mapping(address => uint256) private _balances;\\r\\n    mapping(address => mapping(address => uint256)) private _allowances;\\r\\n\\r\\n    // --- \\u4e8b\\u4ef6 ---\\r\\n    event Transfer(address indexed from, address indexed to, uint256 value);\\r\\n    event Approval(address indexed owner, address indexed spender, uint256 value);\\r\\n\\r\\n    // \\u6784\\u9020\\u51fd\\u6570\\uff1a\\u90e8\\u7f72\\u5408\\u7ea6\\u65f6\\u81ea\\u52a8\\u6267\\u884c\\uff0c\\u5c06\\u90e8\\u7f72\\u8005\\u8bbe\\u4e3a owner\\r\\n    constructor() {\\r\\n        owner = msg.sender;\\r\\n    }\\r\\n\\r\\n    // --- \\u53ea\\u8bfb\\u67e5\\u8be2 ---\\r\\n    // \\u67e5\\u8be2\\u67d0\\u5730\\u5740\\u7684\\u4f59\\u989d\\r\\n    function balanceOf(address account) public view returns (uint256) {\\r\\n        return _balances[account];\\r\\n    }\\r\\n\\r\\n    // \\u67e5\\u8be2 spender \\u8fd8\\u80fd\\u82b1 owner \\u591a\\u5c11\\u4ee3\\u5e01\\r\\n    function allowance(address _owner, address spender) public view returns (uint256) {\\r\\n        return _allowances[_owner][spender];\\r\\n    }\\r\\n\\r\\n    // --- TODO 1: \\u8f6c\\u8d26 ---\\r\\n    // \\u8981\\u6c42\\uff1ato \\u4e0d\\u80fd\\u662f\\u96f6\\u5730\\u5740\\uff1bmsg.sender \\u4f59\\u989d\\u5fc5\\u987b\\u8db3\\u591f\\uff1b\\r\\n    // \\u6263 msg.sender\\u3001\\u52a0 to\\uff1b\\u53d1\\u51fa Transfer \\u4e8b\\u4ef6\\uff1b\\u8fd4\\u56de true\\u3002\\r\\n    function transfer(address to, uint256 value) public returns (bool) {\\r\\n        require(to != address(0), \\\"ERC20: transfer to the zero address\\\");\\r\\n        require(_balances[msg.sender] >= value, \\\"ERC20: transfer amount exceeds balance\\\");\\r\\n        \\r\\n        _balances[msg.sender] -= value;\\r\\n        _balances[to] += value;\\r\\n        emit Transfer(msg.sender, to, value);\\r\\n        return true;\\r\\n    }\\r\\n\\r\\n    // --- TODO 2: \\u6388\\u6743 ---\\r\\n    // \\u8981\\u6c42\\uff1a\\u8bb0\\u5f55 msg.sender \\u5141\\u8bb8 spender \\u82b1 value\\uff1b\\u53d1\\u51fa Approval \\u4e8b\\u4ef6\\uff1b\\u8fd4\\u56de true\\u3002\\r\\n    function approve(address spender, uint256 value) public returns (bool) {\\r\\n        _allowances[msg.sender][spender] = value;\\r\\n        emit Approval(msg.sender, spender, value);\\r\\n        return true;\\r\\n    }\\r\\n\\r\\n    // --- TODO 3: \\u4ee3\\u6263\\u8f6c\\u8d26 ---\\r\\n    // \\u8981\\u6c42\\uff1afrom \\u7684\\u4f59\\u989d\\u5fc5\\u987b\\u8db3\\u591f\\uff1bmsg.sender \\u5728 from \\u5904\\u7684\\u989d\\u5ea6\\u5fc5\\u987b\\u8db3\\u591f\\uff1b\\r\\n    // \\u989d\\u5ea6\\u51cf value\\uff1b\\u6263 from\\u3001\\u52a0 to\\uff1b\\u53d1\\u51fa Transfer \\u4e8b\\u4ef6\\uff1b\\u8fd4\\u56de true\\u3002\\r\\n    function transferFrom(address from, address to, uint256 value) public returns (bool) {\\r\\n        require(_balances[from] >= value, \\\"ERC20: transfer amount exceeds balance\\\");\\r\\n        require(_allowances[from][msg.sender] >= value, \\\"ERC20: transfer amount exceeds allowance\\\");\\r\\n        \\r\\n        _allowances[from][msg.sender] -= value;\\r\\n        _balances[from] -= value;\\r\\n        _balances[to] += value;\\r\\n        emit Transfer(from, to, value);\\r\\n        return true;\\r\\n    }\\r\\n\\r\\n    // --- TODO 4: \\u589e\\u53d1 (\\u53ea\\u6709 owner \\u80fd\\u8c03) ---\\r\\n    // \\u8981\\u6c42\\uff1ato \\u4e0d\\u80fd\\u662f\\u96f6\\u5730\\u5740\\uff1btotalSupply \\u52a0 value\\uff1bto \\u4f59\\u989d\\u52a0 value\\uff1b\\r\\n    // \\u53d1\\u51fa Transfer \\u4e8b\\u4ef6\\uff0cfrom \\u586b address(0)\\u3002\\r\\n    function mint(address to, uint256 value) public onlyOwner {\\r\\n        require(to != address(0), \\\"ERC20: mint to the zero address\\\");\\r\\n        \\r\\n        totalSupply += value;\\r\\n        _balances[to] += value;\\r\\n        emit Transfer(address(0), to, value);\\r\\n    }\\r\\n\\r\\n    // --- TODO 5: \\u9500\\u6bc1\\u81ea\\u5df1\\u7684\\u4ee3\\u5e01 ---\\r\\n    // \\u8981\\u6c42\\uff1amsg.sender \\u4f59\\u989d\\u5fc5\\u987b\\u8db3\\u591f\\uff1b\\u4f59\\u989d\\u51cf value\\uff1btotalSupply \\u51cf value\\uff1b\\r\\n    // \\u53d1\\u51fa Transfer \\u4e8b\\u4ef6\\uff0cto \\u586b address(0)\\u3002\\r\\n    function burn(uint256 value) public {\\r\\n        require(_balances[msg.sender] >= value, \\\"ERC20: burn amount exceeds balance\\\");\\r\\n        \\r\\n        _balances[msg.sender] -= value;\\r\\n        totalSupply -= value;\\r\\n        emit Transfer(msg.sender, address(0), value);\\r\\n    }\\r\\n}\",\"keccak256\":\"0xbfbea4e1e377a8a8bc6a16a99882b395037dc01ecf8ac78a4ec59f67bf3be4ef\",\"license\":\"MIT\"}},\"version\":1}",
